    "explanation": "Stitches prefers Maps where Hook can easily be used through impassable terrain and/or near choke points while teams tend to group. This way your team gets the opportunity to quickly take down an enemy Hero before their team is able to respond.\n\nThe high amount of waveclear he provides makes Stitches a good pick on 3-lane Maps where the metagame strategy is to rotate between two lanes (for example Volskaya Foundry).\n\nDue to his lack of mobility to escape himself and peeling to protect the rest of his team, Stitches does not like Maps where the enemy team can easily gank him or flank his team before he can even get a chance to use Hook from the distance."
  },
